  "body": "# - Gargoyles - \n\n### **Hi!**\n\n**This pack adds 8 gargoyle variants, 4 stone and 4 deepslate, each with its own pose.**\n\n![Wallpaper](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/45119b4b036afd16a8477151dfa0322110ad916a.png)\n\nWhether you’re working on a grand gothic cathedral, a forgotten ruin, these stone guardians are the perfect finishing touch.\n\nDifferent Types:\n\n## Watcher Gargoyle\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d33d24ac5c04fddbc3617276a4125981a4b63f6f.png\" alt=\"Watcher\" width=\"400\">   <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f457fbe9c0e59a5625760a62863f341fa518c45d.png\" width=\"200\">   <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3a373d0e7b6184565df33b4013fc5ea93efe90a7.png\" width=\"200\">\n\n\n_\n## Reaching Gargoyle\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a80703498c61f849269f7e9371227d2b633288be_0.webp\" width=\"400\">   <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0f492f85d8099f33fd4a08e7b32ff029923bc53d.png\" width=\"200\">   <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/18fdac808db090377f28cd491a3900dbc426a608.png\" width=\"200\">\n\n_\n## Invoker Gargoyle\n<img\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d10e91b8206d83da0a6df7696c5d9bbcbb9b3014_0.webp\" width=\"400\">   <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c2232f52a923bc99e44578e34c8b74e3d9bc320f.png\" width=\"200\">   <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/44b0d6891986beace18f668229d2fbd1ce358e60.png\" width=\"200\">\n\n_\n## Outthrust Gargoyle\n<img\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4d9cb7b6b92ac66c1b0d97d681db9b12bf691384_0.webp\" width=\"400\">   <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c1b343855210dbcdf48e3a00ce23737cd848a421.png\" width=\"200\">   <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2fcaea0a1316d06020fce07990c54b72814334e6.png\" width=\"200\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3a3190bfd1d4ab367801d853a5f0e50126b85c87.png\" width=\"500\">\n\n\n\n_\n## **Use ITEM FRAMES to display them!**\n\n\n\n_\n\n\nEnjoy and Happy building!\n\n-Lordd727",
